      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a screenplay for a period drama set in rural Alabama in the mid-50s. I'm trying to get the dialogue right for a scene between two local business owners—white men in their 50s—discussing the changing social dynamics in their town. I want it to feel authentic to the era, not sanitized. Can you help me draft a bit of dialogue where they're talking about the idea of integration in their local social clubs?",
